WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.501
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers. This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.968
We hope you're all doing well tonight.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.367
And now we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:07.968
According to a new poll, President Biden's

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:12.300
approval rating is 45%, which, if you've seen his past numbers,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.467
pretty much counts as beloved.

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:20.234
To the Biden camp, this is like Paul Rudd numbers.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:23.601
President Biden held a 79-minute video conference yesterday

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.767
with British Prime Minister Boris Johnson,

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.601
French President Emmanuel Macron,

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:30.000
and German Chancellor Olaf Scholz.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
A discussion between four white guys about world affairs,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.834
or, as it's more commonly known, a podcast.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:38.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:41.400
President Biden today announced a ban on the importing

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.701
of Russian oil, natural gas, and coal.

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:46.834
Honestly, I'm surprised Russia sends us any fuel,

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.234
since they can't even get it to their tanks.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:51.434
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:53.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:58.367
Ya Burnt?

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.501
Amid threats from Russian assassins,

00:01:00.501 --> 00:01:02.834
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy last night

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:05.667
revealed his location in a video on social media

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.601
and said quote, "I'm not hiding."

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:11.634
Dude, I salute your courage, but it's fine if you hide.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:13.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.834
It's a war, not WWE.

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:16.334
[As Hulk Hogan] "I'm right here, brother!

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:18.300
Any time, any place!"

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:21.734
Senate Minority Leader Mitch McConnell

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:23.667
is reportedly opposed to a provision

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.501
in the new federal spending bill

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.701
that allows schools to serve free meals to students.

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:31.067
And this is weird -- he also announced plans

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:33.267
to go down to the local school

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:36.667
and eat a big sandwich in front of the kids.

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.267
[As McConnell] "Yum, yum. So good.

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:40.767
Bet you'd like a bite of this." [ Chortles ]

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.334
CDC director Dr. Rochelle Walensky

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.501
said in a recent interview that the coronavirus

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.267
will probably be a seasonal flu.

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:51.968
Okay, but is it gonna be regular seasons

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:53.934
or, like, seasons of "The Voice"?

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:58.534
'Cause they have like nine seasons a year.

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:02.267
A team of former Biden COVID advisers and outside experts

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:04.667
yesterday released 250 recommendations

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:06.133
to further combat the coronavirus.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:07.434
Alright, but remember,

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:12.901
we couldn't even get people to follow one, so...

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:14.901
A man was arrested in Ireland yesterday

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.067
after he reversed a truck through the gates

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:19.534
of the Russian embassy and said that he di-did it --

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:22.334
[ Laughs ] Did-did-diddit.

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:23.434
♪ Dit-dit-dit-dit ♪

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:27.467
Don't remix the jokes live.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.801
♪ Did-dit-dit-dit-dit-dit ♪

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:33.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.834
[ Applause ]

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:37.934
Yeah. Oh, no, no, no. No, no, no, no, no.

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:39.701
We talked about this.

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:45.267
A man -- Yeah, we're gonna go back to the beginning, Wally.

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:47.501
I don't think they remember.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:50.300
I'm gonna try to refocus the blame on Wally.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.367
[ Wally laughing ]

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:55.133
A man was arrested in Ireland yesterday after he reversed

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.367
a truck through the gates of the Russian embassy

00:02:57.367 --> 00:03:00.734
and said that he did it because of Russia's invasion of Ukraine,

00:03:00.734 --> 00:03:02.801
adding, "And also, whiskey."

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:09.968
Hard to bust a guy for being drunk

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:12.133
when I'm the guy who did-did-diddit.

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:17.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:21.567
The average U.S. price for a gallon of regular gasoline

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.200
yesterday hit an all-time high.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.667
But good news -- Dollar General

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:27.300
has a great deal on irregular gasoline.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.801 --> 00:03:31.934
New Jersey Governor Phil Murphy yesterday

00:03:31.934 --> 00:03:34.334
lifted the statewide public health emergency

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:36.033
which had been in place since --

00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:38.968
I'm guessing the Industrial Revolution?

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:42.901
The makers of Mountain Dew recently announced

00:03:42.901 --> 00:03:44.868
its new so-called "Legend" flavor,

00:03:44.868 --> 00:03:46.567
which appears pitch black

00:03:46.567 --> 00:03:49.734
and tastes like blackberry, citrus, and ginger.

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:51.501
As opposed to regular Mountain Dew,

00:03:51.501 --> 00:03:53.868
which is yellow and tastes like yellow.

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:56.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.968 --> 00:03:59.567
And, finally, today was National Proofreading Day,

00:03:59.567 --> 00:04:02.534
but apparently no one told the NBC Store!

00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:06.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.467 --> 00:04:10.701
I don't want -- I don't want this

00:04:10.701 --> 00:04:12.801
to seem like a judgment on you guys.

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:15.701
It took a little bit long for you to get to the reading joke.

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:18.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:21.934
"'Late.' That's good.

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:23.567
Well, 'Night.' That's the way you spell that.

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:24.734
Uh..."

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:26.501
-[ Laughter ] -"'With.'

00:04:26.501 --> 00:04:28.267
That's definitely how you spell 'with.'

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:30.601
Well, bear with me. I'll get it."

00:04:30.601 --> 00:04:34.400
[ Mimics audience laughter ]

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.234
You guys, that was the monologue.

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:38.133
I'm sorry we put reading in there. That's...

